{"pageid":4795,"title":"Gumdrop","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Gumdrop</span>","revid":21006,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Gumdrop</b> is a holiday resource that spawns randomly across <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a>. It appears in two variants: <b>Red Gumdrop</b> and <b>Green Gumdrop</b>. Both variants function almost identically and differ only in appearance and price. Gumdrops are typically associated with <b>Christmas-related content</b> and are obtainable exclusively during seasonal <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Events\" title=\"Category:Events\">events</a>. When processed, Gumdrops do <b>not</b> produce standard cash and instead reward <b>snowflake currency only</b>.\n</p><p>Gumdrops are currently <b>unobtainable</b> naturally, and may only be obtained by trading with players, or, the next Christmas event if they are re-added.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\">Variants</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Gumdrop</h2>\n\n\t<div class=\"pi-image-collection wds-tabber\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a997eb6f3f4f-0\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a997eb6f3f4f-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOre\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li role=\"tab\" id=\"pi-tab-6a997eb6f3f4f-1\" class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" aria-controls=\"pi-tabpanel-6a997eb6f3f4f-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tab